Mass of ⁶Li:  
Mass of proton ≈ 0.938272 GeV/c²  
Mass of neutron ≈ 0.939565 GeV/c²  
So mass of ⁶Li ≈ 3*(0.938272 + 0.939565) = 3*1.877837 = 5.633511 GeV/c².  
More precise: ⁶Li atomic mass = 6.015122 u, 1 u = 0.931494 GeV/c² → mass ≈ 6.015122 * 0.931494 ≈ 5.602 GeV/c²? Let's compute:  
